      dynamic_resources_all_lxc.spec.vsm (ratified 07-03) is ALSO impl-pending, and to the
      vsf-s3-alloc NATS crash-loop (S3-ALLOC-NATS-CRASHLOOP-UNROOTED) — all three sit in the
      same s3_resource_alloc.py subsystem. Recommend bundling all three into one DS dispatch
      rather than three separate touches of the same file."

