      lifecycle_status = NULL so .get() returned None, then None[:14] raised
      TypeError. bbh-lab caught a TWIN instance of the same bug on the
      adjacent line (severity column, same crash surface) and fixed both
      (lines 208-209, `(f.get(key) or '?')[:N]` pattern, matching the
      already-correct style used 2 lines below for vuln_type/environment/
      asset). 25 findings total have NULL lifecycle_status in the DB.
